     "value": "City 2-2 · Second"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "United finish two points clear. Sir Alex lifts title number twenty, a year early.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "trophies",
    "items": [
     {
      "kind": "league",
      "label": "United's 20th (imagined)"
     }
    ],
    "person": "ferguson"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "He really did win the league in twenty thirteen, so in this world, that makes twenty-one.",
   "scene": {
